&lt;li&gt;Upgraded API versions: Compute to &lt;code&gt;2026-03-01&lt;/code&gt;, Disk to &lt;code&gt;2026-03-02&lt;/code&gt;, and Gallery to &lt;code&gt;2025-12-03&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
